{"causes": ["The emerging need for genealogical legitimization among powerful Irish families spurred the creation of ancestral figures like Cathair Mór.", "The rich oral tradition of heroic sagas and king lists in ancient Ireland provided a framework for constructing detailed dynastic narratives.", "The desire to establish a clear framework for land inheritance and political succession contributed to the development of legalistic texts like the *Téarmo Cathair Máir*."], "effects": ["Cathair Mór's legendary status provided a foundational genealogical narrative for numerous Leinster families, including the Uí Cheinnselaig.", "The *Téarmo Cathair Máir* perpetuated specific legal and social customs related to land tenure and inheritance in early medieval Ireland.", "His figure reinforced the concept of a High Kingship as a symbolic and aspirational position within Irish political thought and dynastic claims."], "relationships": [{"sourceSlug": "irish-genealogy", "sourceName": "Irish Genealogy", "verb": "INFLUENCES", "targetSlug": "cathair-mr", "targetName": "Cathair Mór", "context": "The established traditions of Irish genealogy profoundly shaped the development and perpetuation of Cathair Mór's legendary status and ancestral claims."}, {"sourceSlug": "cathair-mr", "sourceName": "Cathair Mór", "verb": "OCCURS_IN", "targetSlug": "ireland", "targetName": "Ireland", "context": "The legendary reign and ancestral narratives of Cathair Mór are set primarily within the geographical bounds of ancient Ireland."}, {"sourceSlug": "cathair-mr", "sourceName": "Cathair Mór", "verb": "CREATES", "targetSlug": "tearm-cathair-mair", "targetName": "Téarmo Cathair Máir", "context": "Cathair Mór is the purported author of the *Téarmo Cathair Máir*, a significant medieval text detailing his legendary will and inheritance."}, {"sourceSlug": "cathair-mr", "sourceName": "Cathair Mór", "verb": "INFLUENCES", "targetSlug": "ui-cheinnselaig", "targetName": "Uí Cheinnselaig", "context": "Cathair Mór